{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "combo-f-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 玩家普攻｜执行流程\n受控激活→原Task／CMC连续Main→End→独立攻击／移动许可→真实请求分支；无请求等原Task与CMC两完成事实。\nSection只投影；新段关闭两门。Required失败沿原Task事实→GA正式End。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段说明]] · [[GGYGO_结构_玩家普攻连段.canvas|结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|GAS流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2720,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-start",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. 受控 Try → 原激活\nTryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary(Spec)返回Accepted和Original。\nInitializeAbilityActivation / ActivateAbilityBody接收同一来源。\n校验配置/Avatar、Super/Commit/Task Ready。\n每次外调返回复核Original/段/原Task。\n首次激活键不作下一段请求。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-main",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. StartStep(Original,i)\n退原Trace／FX／CMC／Task，建立两门关闭的新资源。\nBuildSourceBindingRange(Main,End)→校验启用点→ConfigureOriginalMontageNotifies→Ready。\n原Snapshot固定实例／位置／速率→InitializeStepMotion→CMC BeginMontageActionMotion与原完成观察。\n早到事实／非零起播分别按名核原快照；Required失败清Task并正式End。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. WaitComboInput→HandleInputPressed\n真实新按下带SourceStep/RequestId，服务器先消费原GAS事件。\n核Original/当前段/递增号/本原资源门。\n门关闭或Next=NONE：RejectRequest，不存Pending、不在过点重播。\n门开且Next有效：一次真实新请求进入即时换段分支。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-window",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 原Montage事实交付\n原AnimInstance NotifyBegin→Task NotifyReceived→HandleMontageNotify，核原实例及该名字声明。\n攻击点→OpenAttackContinuation，只开攻击门。\n移动点→TryOpenMovementInterruption；实际位置到Main末端才BeginMovementInterruption→Query／Subscribe合格移动。\nSection只投影；typed Hit窗口→OpenTraceWindow／ReleaseTraceWindow。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-branch",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 本原资源许可分支\n攻击门开＋真实新攻击＋Next有效→StartStep(Original,Next,0,RequestId)，新段关闭两门。\n移动门开＋Qualified→重查原Scope／Intent，持原CMC Handle才可取消。\n无新请求→同一原Task／CMC继续完整Main→End。\nDisabled保持对应门关闭；旧事实／旧栈不清后继。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. 原动作取消 / 自然收尾\nQualified复核一致→CancelMontageActionMotionForMovement(原Handle,Intent)→退休门→End(Original,true,true)。\n无请求：原BlendOut→NotifyMontageActionNaturalBlendOut；Task Completed→ReleaseMontageActionMotion(Completed)有限drain。\nCMC AfterMovement末贡献消费→原Handle完成事实。TryCompleteStepMotion两事实齐全才自然End(Authority,false)。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-clean",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "7. 原请求驱动派生Cleanup\nRequired历史发送Task已EndTask；GA核自身Original/段/强Task/资源，Get(true)拒销毁标志，不要求仍Active。\nContext匹配Original，先退休门、脱成员/段/Timer/订阅/Motion。\n原CMC UnsubscribeQualifiedMovementIntent/ReleaseMontageActionMotion；原World/Trace/Mesh退Timer/窗口并恢复Tick/URO/prerequisite。\n退原callbacks/结束Task；Task按原AnimInstance精确撤自身Notify订阅，清原播放/输入/Ticket。\n基类执行native End；旧栈不清后继，普通Cancel保持。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-correct",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "权威确认 / 拒绝与来源\nSendAuthoritativeStep→ASC ClientCorrectAbilityState(Spec,key,TargetData)。\nASC筛原Spec/实例/key；Combo ReceiveAbilityCorrection核单项确切类型、范围/Revision。\nCurrentStepRequestId按请求号拒旧接受回滚，不按段数排序，支持03→01。\n合法不同步纠正→StartStep(SafePosition)，原Task点/实际位置认证许可；返回复核原资源。\n原激活证明仍只由核心GAS维护。",
      "x": 1590,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "真实Owned命中 → HandleMeleeHit\nCombat回调给OriginalWindow/Actor/HitResult。\nCombo核对固定Original、段token、原Task/Window及服务器权限。\nValidateDamageEffectDependency只解析本次已选模式。\nBuildHitEffectPayload生成同一次Spec/Cue数据。\n有效原来源才进入正常或故障分支。",
      "x": 1590,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-hit-normal",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "正常命中\n显式无GE且Shared关闭→合法Cue数据，跳过Apply。\n必需GE每命中新Spec，快照当时攻击力及Buff。\n返回GE选择倍率模式→写DamageMultiplier；绝对模式→写Damage；削韧独立写PoiseDamage。\nASC Apply→GE／Execution／HealthSet。\n合法CueTag→ExecuteGameplayCue；免疫／拒绝仍保碰撞Cue。\n原动作继续等窗口或自然结束。",
      "x": 2180,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-hit-fault",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "PlayerCombo运行命中故障\n已选必需GE失效/缺失，或Builder失败。\n记录GA/Source/Target/段/Montage/配置与原因。\nRequestAbilityEnd(固定Original,true,true)，随即return；该hit不Apply/Cue。\n不可用户取消的Exclusive原能力仍走正式End。\nBoss命中GE/Builder失败只拒hit，不套这条整动作政策。",
      "x": 1590,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-native",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "8. native GA结束数据广播\nOnGameplayAbilityEndedWithData保留实际End的复制／取消参数。\n项目Cleanup已返回；原Task已Finished／OwnerFinished，UE ActiveTasks此时仍可登记这些原Task。\nnative End随后遍历任务并Reset账本，再通知ASC。\n该早通知不表示完整End已经返回。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 410,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-f-completed",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "9. ASC本地通知 → 协议Completed\nnative任务账本清空后广播OnAbilityEnded；replicate字段固定false，cancel保留实际值。\n原请求的必要调用均已退出→ASC发布恰一次Completed，保留Original／Kind与首次终止参数。\n受控调用方在真实调用返回后才可继续下一次激活。\nraw激活缺外层受控Try见证→返回UnsupportedEntry，不发布协议Completed。\n[[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|原请求完整退出流程]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
